ed_name": "seconds"}, {"widget": {"name": "batch_size"}, "name": "batch_size", "label": "batch_size", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "batch_size"}], "flags": {}, "id": 49, "type": "EmptyMiniMaxMusic3LatentAudio", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "EmptyMiniMaxMusic3LatentAudio"}, "order": 7}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "FLOAT", "links": [21, 33], "label": "FLOAT", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "FLOAT"}], "size": [270, 58], "pos": [71.71721649169922, 925.4747924804688], "widgets_values": [150], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "id": 55, "type": "PrimitiveFloat", "title": "时长", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveFloat"}, "order": 4}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "links": [20, 24], "label": "CONDITIONING", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "CONDITIONING"}, {"name": "seconds", "label": "seconds", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "seconds"}], "size": [398.413818359375, 430.0090637207031], "pos": [482.4142761230469, 119.84846496582031], "widgets_values": ["全局风格：Lo-fi hip-hop, chillhop. 78 BPM, D♭ major, major scale with jazzy extensions. Extremely laid-back, dreamy and warm. A slow rainy-day atmosphere with no sense of urgency. The feeling of staying in bed while rain falls outside, sleeping late, staring at the ceiling, listening to the rain through headphones, and letting the whole day pass without doing anything.\n\nThe emotional theme is simple: rainy day, relax, sleep in, do nothing, think about nothing, no deadlines, no pressure, no need to be productive. A quiet little escape from the outside world.\n\nBedroom production: muddy warm texture, heavy vinyl crackle, soft tape hiss, subtle wow-and-flutter pitch wobble, low-passed dusty mix, soft-clipped drums, slightly detuned instruments, cozy analog imperfections. Everything should feel soft, sleepy and close.\n\nVocal Details: Soft androgynous vocal, hushed half-sung half-spoken delivery, very relaxed and slightly sleepy. Gentle breathy timbre, lazy behind-the-beat phrasing. Vocal sits low in the mix like another instrument. Sparse double-tracked harmonies. Occasional quiet \"嗯……\", \"哦……\", \"啦……\" hums with tape delay and warm spring reverb. Long stretches with no vocals. Never sound energetic or dramatic.\n\nArrangement: Dusty boom-bap drums with a soft thumping kick, lazy swung cracked snare, brushed hi-hats, warm round sub bass. Warm Rhodes piano chords with slow chorus wobble. Mellow jazzy guitar answering vocal phrases. Constant vinyl crackle and rain ambience.\n\nIntro: Heavy rain outside the window, vinyl crackle, room tone. Rhodes slowly fades in. No drums at first. The listener should immediately feel sleepy.\n\nVerse 1: Extremely minimal. Rain, Rhodes, soft bass and barely audible drums.\n\nInstrumental 1: Rain and Rhodes dominate. Guitar enters with very sparse jazzy phrases.\n\nVerse 2: Slightly fuller groove but still sleepy and relaxed.\n\nChorus: Very simple, memorable, repetitive. The central message is \"今天什么都不想做\". Soft harmonies and humming.\n\nInstrumental 2: Extended lazy rainy-day groove.\n\nBridge: Everything almost disappears. Rain, vinyl crackle and floating Rhodes. Vocal sounds distant and half-asleep.\n\nFinal Chorus: Slightly warmer and fuller, but never energetic.\n\nOutro: Slowly remove drums, bass, guitar and Rhodes until only rain and vinyl crackle remain. End with a soft unresolved Rhodes chord.", "[Intro]\n\n嗯……\n\n（窗外在下雨）\n\n哦……\n\n今天……\n不想起床……\n\n再睡一会儿吧……\n\n\n\n\n[Verse 1]\n\n窗帘拉得刚刚好\n雨声轻轻敲着窗\n手机丢在床边\n也懒得看一眼\n\n被子盖到肩膀\n房间有一点点凉\n今天没有什么事\n也不想去想\n\n雨一直下\n时间慢慢走\n我翻个身\n继续躺着就好\n\n天还没亮透\n我也还没醒\n这样的下午\n好像什么都可以不用管\n\n\n\n\n[Instrumental]\n\n嗯……\n\n雨下得真慢……\n\n哦……\n\n就这样吧……\n\n\n\n\n[Verse 2]\n\n睡到几点都没关系\n闹钟今天先关掉\n外面的世界那么吵\n刚好听不见就好\n\n不用赶路\n不用回消息\n不用想着明天\n也不用证明自己\n\n热茶放在桌上\n凉一点也没关系\n窗外灰灰的天空\n看起来刚刚好\n\n雨滴顺着玻璃往下\n一条一条慢慢流\n我什么都不想\n只是看着它走\n\n\n\n\n[Chorus]\n\n嗯……今天什么都不想做\n（就这样吧，就这样吧）\n\n哦……再睡一会儿也没错\n（慢一点，慢一点）\n\n嗯……让雨替我说\n（今天不用想太多）\n\n哦……闭上眼睛就好了\n（什么都不用做）\n\n\n\n\n[Instrumental]\n\nRain ambience stays prominent.\n\nRhodes plays slow, warm jazzy chords.\n\nLazy guitar phrases appear between the rain.\n\nSoft boom-bap drums swing quietly underneath.\n\nLong instrumental breathing space.\n\nNo vocals for an extended section.\n\n\n\n\n[Verse 3]\n\n下午的光很柔软\n落在床单的一角\n窗外的人撑着伞\n匆匆忙忙地跑\n\n而我还在这里\n抱着我的枕头\n听着雨声发呆\n什么都没有想\n\n晚一点再吃饭吧\n晚一点再起床\n今天的时间很多\n不用那么慌\n\n如果梦还没醒\n那就继续做吧\n反正雨还没有停\n夜也还很长\n\n\n\n\n[Instrumental]\n\n啦……\n\n嗯……\n\n雨声盖住城市……\n\n被子盖住世界……\n\n\n\n\n[Bridge]\n\n今天不用努力……\n\n不用赶上什么……\n\n不用成为谁……\n\n也不用想明天……\n\n\n\n\n听一会儿雨吧……\n\n然后……\n\n再睡一觉……\n\n\n\n\n[Instrumental]\n\nDrums disappear completely.\n\nOnly rain, vinyl crackle, tape hiss and floating detuned Rhodes.\n\nVery distant guitar harmonics.\n\nA sleepy, almost weightless atmosphere.\n\nAfter a long pause, the soft kick slowly returns.\n\n\n\n\n[Final Chorus]\n\n嗯……今天什么都不想做\n（就这样吧，就这样吧）\n\n哦……再睡一会儿也没错\n（慢一点，慢一点）\n\n嗯……让雨替我说\n（今天不用想太多）\n\n哦……闭上眼睛就好了\n（什么都不用做）\n\n嗯……窗外还在下着雨\n（就让它一直下）\n\n哦……我也不急着醒来\n（再睡一会儿吧）\n\n嗯……如果世界太吵\n（那就关掉吧）\n\n哦……今天只想躺着\n（什么都不想）\n\n\n\n\n[Instrumental]\n\nExtended rainy-day Lo-fi groove.\n\nRhodes slowly repeats a warm jazzy progression.\n\nGuitar answers with sparse sleepy phrases.\n\nSoft drums become increasingly distant.\n\nRain gradually becomes louder than the music.\n\n\n\n\n[Outro]\n\n嗯……\n\n雨还在下……\n\n被子还是暖的……\n\n哦……\n\n那就……\n\n再睡一会儿……\n\n\n\n\n不用起床……\n\n不用想了……\n\n什么都不用做……\n\n\n\n\n嗯……\n\n晚安……\n\n或者……\n\n下午好……\n\n\n\n\n（雨声）\n\n（黑胶噪声）\n\n（最后一个 Rhodes 和弦慢慢消失）", 273570149453881, "randomize", 60.000000000000014, 1.7, 50], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 19, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "caption"}, "name": "caption", "link": 34, "label": "caption", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "caption"}, {"widget": {"name": "lyrics"}, "name": "lyrics", "link": 35, "label": "lyrics", "t